{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/15XKG44gYKTgWh9SDTMEJQ?scene=1","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:01.938817+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/15XKG44gYKTgWh9SDTMEJQ?scene=1","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/7PHE45dlpeZEChe4wstJENjpIMYJPiaZW5JHOkScCGNueiaC1IxSCfGXVM7YmjTXxsrhFKibDoIicIeoRZIcW13FHtibEh96URwT57QGIKdHYqfk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><p><span><span>2020年年底，国务院学位委员会、教育部正式在交叉学科门类下设置国家安全学一级学科。这一举措意义重大，是夯实国家安全领域科学研究和人才培养的关键之举。2021年北京师范大学成功获批全国首批“国家安全学”一级学科博士学位授权点，国家安全与应急管理学院作为“国家安全学”一级学科的主建单位，承担着极为重要的建设任务。学院面向国家重大需求，围绕国家安全战略、国家安全治理、国家安全技术等学科方向开展建设，在国家防范化解重大风险、应对重大国际局势变化、抗御重大自然灾害、防控重大公共卫生突发事件、参与全球治理等方面开展科学研究、政策咨询、智库建设，培养具有扎实学识、使命担当、全球视野、全局观念、战略思维的国家安全与应急管理领域新兴复合型高层次人才。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>为增进优秀大学生对北京师范大学国家安全学学科建设及相关领域的认识与了解，促进互动交流，北京师范大学国家安全与应急管理学院将于2026年7月3-4日举办“全国优秀大学生夏令营”。夏令营包含专业方向介绍、学术讲座、师生互动等多个环节，旨在让营员深入了解北京师范大学国家安全与应急管理学院的师资、科研和人才培养情况，</span></span><span><span>熟悉粮食安全、能源安全、城市安全、生态环境安全等领域的研究内容</span></span><span><span>，了解国家安全研究的学术前沿。</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><strong><span><span>一、活动时间地点</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>2026年7月3-4日（7月2日下午报到）</span></span></strong></span><span><span>，北京师范大学</span><span><strong><span>珠海校区</span></strong></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><strong><span><span>二、申请资格</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>1.全国各高等院校本科三年级优秀在校生(2027年应届毕业生)，</span></span><span><span>优先考虑与学院学科研究方向契合程度高的相关专业</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.思想品德良好、身心健康、遵纪守法、学习成绩优秀、外语水平良好、科研能力出色、预计能够获得硕士推荐免试资格的学生；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.对国家安全学学科有浓厚兴趣，有志于从事国家安全相关领域的学术研究工作。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><strong><span><span>三、申请方式</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>申请人于2026年6月17日前登录北京师范大学夏令营申请系统(https://xly.bnu.edu.cn/xly)按系统要求进行报名，提交相关材料，逾期不再接受申请。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.《北京师范大学全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表》1份，系统填写并下载打印；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.本科阶段成绩单（教务部门盖章）1份；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.《专家推荐信》2封，需要2位副教授及以上职称专家分别推荐；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.《夏令营个人自述》1份，模板见系统；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.大学英语四、六级考试成绩单等外语成绩复印件1份；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6.其他证明材料复印件(如已发表论文、各类获奖或资格证书等)各1份。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>温馨提示：</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>以上材料1-5项为必须项，请务必提交，第6项可自愿提交。上述材料</span><span><strong><span>按顺序合成一个PDF文件</span></strong></span><span>(命名为：姓名+学校+手机号)上传至北京师范大学研究生院夏令营申请系统-上传材料-其他材料一栏。本期不需要邮寄纸质材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>报到时请携带《北京师范大学优秀大学生夏令营活动申请表》、身份证、学生证、其他申请人自愿递交的证明材料原件以供核对，如发现弄虚作假者即取消夏令营资格。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><strong><span><span>四、审核入营</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>材料审核与营员接收工作将在6月26日左右结束，接收营员名单将在国家安全与应急管理学院网站（https://nsem.bnu.edu.cn/）公布并直接通知本人（以短信或电话形式）。届时未接到通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><strong><span><span>五、营员人数</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>约</span></span></span><span><span><span>60</span></span></span><span><span><span>人</span></span></span><span><span><span>（具体录取人数按实际申请情况确定）。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><strong><span><span>六、日程安排</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>本次夏令营活动日程共2天（7月3-4日），7月2日下午报到。详细安排以后续通知为准。导师情况可参考网页：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>https://nsem.bnu.edu.cn/szdw/jxky/index.htm</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><strong><span><span>七、活动费用及入营资助</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>1.学院为所有营员解决在营期间餐费、购买在营期间人身意外伤害保险，为异地营员提供在营期间校内住宿。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.交通费用需营员自理。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.营员报到后要求全程参加夏令营活动，擅自离营者将取消营员资格，并自行承担所有费用。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><strong><span><span>八、联系方式</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>联系人：张老师</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>电话：010-58800730</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>电子邮件: ns@bnu.edu.cn</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><strong><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/15XKG44gYKTgWh9SDTMEJQ?scene=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件：2026年夏令营专家推荐信模板.doc</a></span></span></strong></section><section><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>欢迎各高校2027年优秀应届本科毕业生积极报名!</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong><section><section><p><span><span><span><span>韩书阳 </span></span></span></span><span><span><span>| 排版</span></span></span></p><section><span><span><span>宋月光 | 初审</span></span></span></section><section><section><section><span><span><span>白   雪 | 复审</span></span></span></section><p><span><span><span>刘   凯 | 终审</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span></span></p><section><hr/><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>声 明：</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>本账号为北京师范大学国家安全与应急管理学院官方微信公众号。本文内容如需转载，转载信息时请联系我们，标注原作者，本号等信息来源。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>温馨提示：</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>由于微信订阅号推送规则更新，建议您将“</span></span></span><strong><span><span>北师大国安院</span></span></strong><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><strong><span><span>设为星标</span></span></strong><span><span><span>，便可在消息栏中便捷地找到我们，及时了解最新资讯！操作步骤为：进入“北师大国安院”公众号 → 点击右上角的 ··· 菜单 → 选择「设为星标」，即可完成。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>点击底部左下方“</span></span></span><strong><span><span>阅读原文</span></span></strong><span><span><span>”，进入国安院官网。</span></span></span></span></p></section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span><span>往期回顾</span></span></strong></section><section><strong><span><span>BREAK AWAY</span></span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/7PHE45dlpeYwlrjEKNLZZgKjpjv1yns1VMfYHPDOsiatOT6sSwbPB6A1leYhH9lzulaHK6ibySvVwCXlw58W6OfVbyLfibcfHKrhUdOPnvD5TQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNjI1MDEzMA==&amp;mid=2247504041&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=1729fd83221f8b1a758b73ff6e