ion></section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/TDyEibty7hbR7kGhQGjfzpCGicN7wXEkkvN4jyeO4jeIfEwmibibTo2boxcKAdBFFGzlUB2SZC5v2kv9lAoibFoJBDQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><section><span><span>地 址: 北京市海淀区新街口外大街19号</span></span></section><section><span><span>官网：https://nsem.bnu.edu.cn/</span></span></section><section><span><span>邮箱：ns@bnu.edu.cn</span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"841280e113b61a558f9260e600ee8420e7c559efc38bf9b8692e89ff067bfff2","textLength":1980,"sourceSha256":"925e31879c797fc723a2283d406f4f53b4f2570f7ba3a94b5c14de973a219432","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-df2df0924749cd79dce0","title":"2026年北京师范大学国家安全与应急管理学院2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:01.938817+00:00"}
